Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.50,0:05:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(962,1016)}Une pause sans trêve
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.10,0:05:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(962,1016)}Oh, reviens mon ami
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.10,0:05:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(962,1016)}Maintenant, le vent se lève
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.10,0:05:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(962,1016)}Ooohhh Yeahh !
